Error [E-CALL-VALUE]: A function value is invoked with an adjacent call `)(`
  --> tests/ui/E-CALL-VALUE_call_result_not_called.jet:4:23
    |
  4 |     print(make_adder()(1))
    |                       ^
 Why: Named functions and direct field, index, or lambda calls keep their spelling; a returned call result uses `.call(…)` so the value and invocation stay explicit
 Fix: Write `callee.call(…)`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E-CALL-VALUE
